WEBVTT

00:00:01.041 --> 00:00:07.411
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:00:08.211 --> 00:00:15.241
Did you know that when you think
about it, you know little about yourself?

00:00:17.621 --> 00:00:21.061
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:00:21.161 --> 00:00:26.221
When you're about
to give up all hope, look at the sky...

00:00:27.631 --> 00:00:33.121
...because the wind
will gently dry all your tears.

00:00:34.301 --> 00:00:37.101
And then the light
that floods down...

00:00:37.441 --> 00:00:44.071
...from the big stars in the sky will come
down and gently wrap all around you.

00:00:47.421 --> 00:00:52.221
A magical jewel...
Everything you want...

00:00:52.351 --> 00:00:59.421
...is in a haze much thicker
than any dream you have had.

00:00:59.631 --> 00:01:05.661
I can't come to hate you,
but it's just really not enough.

00:01:06.671 --> 00:01:11.631
I have my faith that what I feel is all true.

00:01:12.641 --> 00:01:19.071
Breaking through the wall of steel,
I can now see on the other side.

00:01:19.721 --> 00:01:26.991
The sea that opens to tomorrow,
and it will be shining for me.

00:01:34.731 --> 00:01:37.131
Flame Arrow!

00:01:46.271 --> 00:01:48.901
It was nice meeting you, Magic Knights.

00:01:50.181 --> 00:01:51.701
Until next time.

00:01:51.811 --> 00:01:54.111
Eagle of Autozam...

00:02:01.191 --> 00:02:03.181
But I'm glad.

00:02:03.831 --> 00:02:06.491
Because I got to see you all again.

00:02:20.941 --> 00:02:22.241
That voice...

00:02:22.811 --> 00:02:25.141
I remember hearing it somewhere...

00:02:26.051 --> 00:02:28.141
You should recognize it.

00:02:28.251 --> 00:02:32.151
Lantis over there is the younger
brother of High Priest Zagato.

00:02:32.921 --> 00:02:34.151
Younger brother?

00:02:34.261 --> 00:02:35.281
Zagato's?

00:02:35.691 --> 00:02:41.631
The Magic Knights
and the Battleship NSX

00:03:03.221 --> 00:03:04.621
What's wrong, Umi?

00:03:04.721 --> 00:03:06.191
You can't sleep?

00:03:06.351 --> 00:03:07.951
Y-Yeah...

00:03:16.101 --> 00:03:18.261
May I come in?

00:03:21.241 --> 00:03:22.461
Yes.

00:03:33.321 --> 00:03:34.611
Thank you.

00:03:42.621 --> 00:03:44.751
What about Hikaru and Fuu?

00:03:46.231 --> 00:03:48.161
I think they're asleep.

00:03:53.701 --> 00:03:57.641
Umi, if you can't sleep,
I'll make you an herbal infusion.

00:03:58.341 --> 00:03:59.311
Um...

00:04:02.141 --> 00:04:03.801
Um...

00:04:07.451 --> 00:04:10.251
I've been meaning
to apologize to you.

00:04:11.451 --> 00:04:12.721
Apologize?

00:04:13.191 --> 00:04:15.681
In the beginning,
when I came to Cephiro...

00:04:15.791 --> 00:04:20.751
...I didn't know how
you cherished this country...

00:04:21.731 --> 00:04:24.861
And I didn't listen
to your story at all...

00:04:25.471 --> 00:04:27.661
I was really stuck-up.

00:04:29.001 --> 00:04:29.941
Umi...

00:04:31.441 --> 00:04:33.371
I've always meant to apologize.

00:04:33.481 --> 00:04:36.911
Even when I went back
to my own world from Cephiro...

00:04:37.111 --> 00:04:39.381
You knew
Princess Emeraude's true intent...

00:04:39.481 --> 00:04:44.611
...and still helped us become Magic
Knights even after you became stone.

00:04:45.751 --> 00:04:46.781
And I...

00:04:48.561 --> 00:04:52.121
In the beginning, I always
thought it was a nuisance...

00:04:52.231 --> 00:04:54.221
Why me?

00:04:54.631 --> 00:04:55.761
I'm sorry.

00:04:59.601 --> 00:05:02.761
Umi, you did nothing wrong.

00:05:04.211 --> 00:05:06.301
Abruptly summoned
from another world...

00:05:06.411 --> 00:05:09.211
...and involved in
a battle you were no part of.

00:05:09.311 --> 00:05:12.041
Anyone would think as you did.

00:05:12.151 --> 00:05:15.081
You have no reason
to apologize to me.

00:05:15.681 --> 00:05:16.841
Clef...

00:05:17.251 --> 00:05:20.241
I am the one who
must apologize to you.

00:05:20.821 --> 00:05:25.731
Not only did I not tell the truth behind
the legend of the Magic Knights...

00:05:26.391 --> 00:05:30.801
...but Zagato turned me
to stone, and I could be of no help.

00:05:34.201 --> 00:05:35.641
That's not true.

00:05:36.241 --> 00:05:39.701
You helped us a lot
by communicating with us.

00:05:40.241 --> 00:05:44.701
And Mokona, who you
lent us, worked hard too.

00:05:47.221 --> 00:05:49.211
Girl from another world...

00:05:49.321 --> 00:05:53.251
The legendary Magic Knight
able to save this land of Cephiro...

00:05:55.291 --> 00:06:00.321
I am glad that I could see
you again and thank you like this.

00:06:04.871 --> 00:06:08.891
In this current battle,
think first of protecting yourself.

00:06:09.001 --> 00:06:12.631
The magic I bestowed upon you,
the weapons Presea created...

00:06:12.741 --> 00:06:15.111
...use them all for your own sake.

00:06:16.981 --> 00:06:21.111
Now, I will make you that infusion.
Drink it and sleep well.

00:06:23.321 --> 00:06:25.551
Thank you, Clef.

00:06:37.871 --> 00:06:38.961
Fuu.

00:06:39.931 --> 00:06:41.131
What's wrong?

00:06:41.541 --> 00:06:43.301
Is something the matter?

00:06:49.581 --> 00:06:51.841
Did you have a bad dream?

00:06:54.681 --> 00:06:56.651
I just could not sleep.

00:06:57.221 --> 00:06:58.481
Me neither.

00:07:00.821 --> 00:07:02.261
I was worried.

00:07:03.191 --> 00:07:07.821
I've been worried ever since you
three went back to your other world.

00:07:09.631 --> 00:07:10.791
Ferio...

00:07:11.331 --> 00:07:13.631
Are Hikaru and Umi the same?

00:07:15.341 --> 00:07:19.401
They were both distraught about
Princess Emeraude the whole while.

00:07:24.911 --> 00:07:26.851
You lost some weight.

00:07:31.991 --> 00:07:34.511
You were distraught
all this time as well...

00:07:44.201 --> 00:07:45.361
That orb...

00:07:46.101 --> 00:07:48.041
It's the one I gave you.

00:07:48.141 --> 00:07:52.631
I was certain I had it, but when
I returned to Tokyo, it was gone.

00:07:52.741 --> 00:07:55.731
Ms. Hikaru said
the same thing about hers.

00:07:56.311 --> 00:08:00.111
I don't know why, but both
of them returned to my hands.

00:08:01.221 --> 00:08:04.311
Was it because
we went back to our world?

00:08:11.161 --> 00:08:12.091
Ferio!

00:08:12.491 --> 00:08:13.891
I gave you this.

00:08:14.001 --> 00:08:19.491
But your elder sister gave this to you.
I can't accept something so important.

00:08:19.601 --> 00:08:21.031
It's all right.

00:08:21.501 --> 00:08:24.061
I want you to have this.

00:08:27.881 --> 00:08:31.471
Besides, I'm sure that
my sister wishes it as well.

00:08:37.721 --> 00:08:38.981
Don't cry.

00:08:39.321 --> 00:08:41.791
I don't want to make you cry.

00:08:44.931 --> 00:08:48.951
I last saw my sister
when I was very little...

00:08:49.501 --> 00:08:52.591
...so I only remember her sad face.

00:08:54.671 --> 00:08:57.571
So I at least want you to stay smiling.

00:08:58.441 --> 00:09:02.541
So that when I remember you,
it'll always be your smile...

00:09:03.311 --> 00:09:04.511
Ferio...

00:09:33.071 --> 00:09:35.441
Who... is that?

00:10:05.511 --> 00:10:07.101
That surprised me...

00:10:30.161 --> 00:10:32.791
Um, it was a scary dream...

00:10:32.901 --> 00:10:34.961
A voice... I wonder who...

00:10:36.171 --> 00:10:37.931
What kind of dream was it?

00:10:38.041 --> 00:10:40.671
Um, let's see...

00:10:41.611 --> 00:10:44.671
Um, I don't really know.

00:10:44.951 --> 00:10:47.011
But it was real scary.

00:10:47.121 --> 00:10:50.241
Something very scary eats us all!

00:10:50.751 --> 00:10:52.051
Eats?

00:10:52.491 --> 00:10:53.781
This voice...

00:10:54.061 --> 00:10:55.281
It was...

00:10:56.021 --> 00:10:57.291
I don't know...

00:10:57.391 --> 00:10:59.091
But I'm scared...

00:11:01.331 --> 00:11:02.491
That's...

00:11:04.971 --> 00:11:07.371
Zagato's younger brother...

00:11:09.771 --> 00:11:11.031
Lantis.

00:11:16.441 --> 00:11:21.581
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:23.451 --> 00:11:27.581
Magic Knight Rayearth

00:11:33.961 --> 00:11:35.091
Lantis...

00:11:36.231 --> 00:11:38.101
I'm gonna be eaten...

00:11:38.371 --> 00:11:41.031
I'm gonna be eaten
by a scary dream!

00:11:44.271 --> 00:11:47.041
It's all right. Nothing will eat you.

00:11:47.311 --> 00:11:49.331
Really? Are you sure?

00:11:49.441 --> 00:11:50.381
Yeah.

00:11:50.811 --> 00:11:53.281
So the new Pillar will protect us?

00:11:55.051 --> 00:11:57.311
A new Pillar...

00:11:58.191 --> 00:11:59.651
Mom told me.

00:11:59.751 --> 00:12:02.191
Cephiro is like this now...

00:12:02.291 --> 00:12:05.691
...because Princess Emeraude,
who was the Pillar, went away.

00:12:06.131 --> 00:12:10.591
So if a new Pillar comes,
everything will be peaceful again.

00:12:12.301 --> 00:12:14.231
What's wrong, mister?

00:12:14.541 --> 00:12:17.061
Does your tummy hurt?
Do you feel sick?

00:12:17.171 --> 00:12:18.601
It's nothing.

00:12:19.871 --> 00:12:23.971
You came all the way here in a daze.
Do you remember where you sleep?

00:12:24.481 --> 00:12:25.971
I'll walk you back.

00:12:26.081 --> 00:12:29.521
You won't have any scary
dreams anymore, so sleep well.

00:12:43.431 --> 00:12:45.421
G-Good evening...

00:12:52.211 --> 00:12:54.141
Oh, it's you, miss!

00:12:55.241 --> 00:12:58.441
It's me! Remember
how you saved me?

00:13:31.811 --> 00:13:33.511
Oh, from when...

00:13:33.611 --> 00:13:35.581
You gave me that flower.

00:13:35.681 --> 00:13:37.171
You remembered!

00:13:37.421 --> 00:13:39.411
I'm glad you were all right!

00:13:39.521 --> 00:13:40.491
Yeah!

00:13:40.891 --> 00:13:42.821
He saved me.

00:13:43.291 --> 00:13:48.461
Before my house disappeared,
he brought me here with my mom.

00:13:54.501 --> 00:13:59.411
I'm sorry I couldn't say
"thank you" for saving me.

00:14:00.781 --> 00:14:02.211
That's okay...

00:14:02.311 --> 00:14:04.241
Thank you for that flower.

00:14:06.611 --> 00:14:07.911
Ah, um...

00:14:12.651 --> 00:14:14.521
Where are you going?

00:14:14.621 --> 00:14:16.181
Residential quarters.

00:14:16.291 --> 00:14:19.421
Where I live with my mom!

00:14:20.261 --> 00:14:21.231
I see.

00:14:21.331 --> 00:14:23.891
Where the people
of Cephiro evacuated...

00:14:24.971 --> 00:14:26.131
U-Um...

00:14:27.201 --> 00:14:28.861
Can I come with you?

00:14:29.801 --> 00:14:31.831
Will you sleep next to me?

00:14:32.471 --> 00:14:34.501
N-No, I didn't mean that.

00:14:34.611 --> 00:14:38.571
I just wanted to see what
the residential quarters are like.

00:14:38.681 --> 00:14:39.771
Oh...

00:14:39.911 --> 00:14:41.851
You're so strong...

00:14:41.951 --> 00:14:45.891
I thought if I could be with you,
I wouldn't have these scary dreams.

00:14:46.851 --> 00:14:49.691
I'll make sure to visit
you sometime, okay?

00:14:50.021 --> 00:14:52.191
That's a promise! You have to!

00:14:52.931 --> 00:14:54.861
Yeah, it's a promise.

00:15:09.241 --> 00:15:10.841
It's all right.

00:15:10.951 --> 00:15:13.541
I can go back from here by myself.

00:15:17.851 --> 00:15:19.621
Thank you, mister.

00:15:24.061 --> 00:15:26.051
Miss, what's your name?

00:15:27.231 --> 00:15:28.491
Hikaru Shidou.

00:15:29.101 --> 00:15:31.031
Everyone calls me Hikaru.

00:15:31.171 --> 00:15:32.691
Ms. Hikaru!

00:15:33.501 --> 00:15:35.971
Can you tell me your name too?

00:15:36.741 --> 00:15:37.931
Mira!

00:15:40.911 --> 00:15:44.441
See you later, Ms. Hikaru, mister!

00:16:05.071 --> 00:16:06.261
U-Um...

00:16:09.441 --> 00:16:14.171
Um, I heard that you were
High Priest Zagato's younger brother...

00:16:16.141 --> 00:16:17.411
I am.

00:16:18.081 --> 00:16:19.101
I...

00:16:19.281 --> 00:16:21.111
I killed your...

00:16:22.121 --> 00:16:24.351
You can hit me if you want! No...

00:16:24.451 --> 00:16:26.851
I know that
hitting me won't be enough.

00:16:26.951 --> 00:16:30.981
But I want you
to leave Umi and Fuu alone!

00:16:32.231 --> 00:16:34.821
I know I sound selfish saying that...

00:16:34.931 --> 00:16:35.921
But...

00:16:36.161 --> 00:16:39.331
Umi and Fuu weren't
as cheerful back in Tokyo.

00:16:40.031 --> 00:16:44.131
They tried their best to cheer
me up because I got depressed...

00:16:44.471 --> 00:16:47.101
But I think they were
crying when they were alone.

00:16:47.211 --> 00:16:49.971
So if you want to hit us, just hit me!

00:16:53.081 --> 00:16:54.911
I'm not going to hit you.

00:16:57.251 --> 00:17:00.911
Legendary Magic Knight
summoned from another world...

00:17:01.191 --> 00:17:03.621
I have no reason to blame you.

00:17:03.791 --> 00:17:05.121
But I...

00:17:06.791 --> 00:17:09.791
I'm sure you cried when
you were alone as well.

00:17:15.641 --> 00:17:18.231
You should not blame yourselves.

00:17:18.841 --> 00:17:21.571
Rather, I blame Cephiro's...

00:17:21.681 --> 00:17:22.841
No!

00:17:23.211 --> 00:17:25.201
What's all this while I'm asleep?

00:17:26.151 --> 00:17:27.711
Lantis is mine.

00:17:27.821 --> 00:17:31.681
He saved me when I was attacked
by monsters in the Forest of Spirits!

00:17:32.351 --> 00:17:34.411
Oh, he was so handsome...

00:17:34.521 --> 00:17:36.421
My dear Lantis.

00:17:39.391 --> 00:17:43.261
So I'm usually a good girl, but
I'm tough against rivals in romance!

00:17:44.031 --> 00:17:45.791
Rivals in romance?

00:17:46.331 --> 00:17:48.561
Hikaru, look outside the window!

00:18:00.481 --> 00:18:01.571
That's...

00:18:05.251 --> 00:18:06.741
The battleship?

00:18:15.261 --> 00:18:16.191
Clef!

00:18:29.781 --> 00:18:32.141
It's that battleship that we saw.

00:18:32.811 --> 00:18:35.081
I believe it was from Autozam.

00:18:40.721 --> 00:18:46.021
Lantis, you were in Autozam
before you returned here to Cephiro.

00:18:46.831 --> 00:18:49.161
Do you recognize this battleship?

00:18:49.631 --> 00:18:51.061
It's the NSX.

00:18:51.171 --> 00:18:52.261
NSX?

00:18:52.601 --> 00:18:56.471
The battleship of Eagle,
the strongest commander in Autozam.

00:18:57.571 --> 00:19:01.171
That's what the guy in the white
machine said when we fought him.

00:19:05.751 --> 00:19:07.511
Where are you going?

00:19:09.221 --> 00:19:10.981
Eagle of Autozam...

00:19:12.791 --> 00:19:14.451
I want to talk to him.

00:19:15.561 --> 00:19:16.391
Talk?

00:19:17.361 --> 00:19:22.421
I don't want to fight again without
knowing what the other side wants!

00:19:44.521 --> 00:19:45.581
Rayearth!

00:19:46.521 --> 00:19:47.711
Selece!

00:19:49.621 --> 00:19:50.721
Windam!

00:20:20.491 --> 00:20:24.081
Oh, those Rune-Gods from
the other day are here again.

00:20:24.431 --> 00:20:25.891
What? Where?

00:20:27.801 --> 00:20:31.491
Those damn Rune-Gods sent
my cute FTO to the repair dock!

00:20:31.601 --> 00:20:36.701
This was the second time the FTO
broke down and Zazu had to service it.

00:20:36.801 --> 00:20:40.001
Yeah, the first time
it happened was against Lantis.

00:20:46.181 --> 00:20:48.151
It's as huge as ever...

00:20:50.351 --> 00:20:52.911
Fighting that robot
from earlier would be fine...

00:20:53.021 --> 00:20:56.111
...but it might be rather
tough to fight this battleship.

00:20:57.091 --> 00:20:59.581
It'd run us over before we could.

00:21:07.841 --> 00:21:08.771
What?

00:21:09.141 --> 00:21:11.071
What is that sound?

00:21:14.281 --> 00:21:15.371
That's...

00:21:29.821 --> 00:21:30.761
Alcyone!

00:21:33.631 --> 00:21:36.191
Long time no see, Magic Knights.

00:21:36.701 --> 00:21:38.131
So you're alive!

00:21:43.941 --> 00:21:45.411
Astra!

00:21:47.371 --> 00:21:50.811
There's no way the old lady's magic
will work on a Rune-God.

00:21:53.611 --> 00:21:54.711
Umi!

00:21:54.851 --> 00:21:56.041
Ms. Umi!

00:22:17.911 --> 00:22:23.341
You are like the fast wind that blows
across the surface of the ocean.

00:22:23.981 --> 00:22:31.251
And all the dreams you have are always
engulfed in infinite rays of sunlight.

00:22:32.721 --> 00:22:38.251
I don't want to see you with your back
turned to me like you are right now.

00:22:38.961 --> 00:22:42.761
Heading toward the future,
both your wings are broken...

00:22:43.131 --> 00:22:45.531
...yet you hide your pain from me.

00:22:47.331 --> 00:22:50.631
Softly...
Let me wipe all your tears away.

00:22:51.011 --> 00:22:54.371
Softly...
Let me hold you in my embrace.

00:22:54.781 --> 00:23:01.701
Softly... Let me comfort you in my arms
because I want you to be at peace.

00:23:02.121 --> 00:23:05.551
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:05.851 --> 00:23:14.281
Even if you rest your wings now, the
dreams that you see now will not end...

00:23:17.131 --> 00:23:20.461
I'll give you... I'll give you...

00:23:20.701 --> 00:23:28.771
If you have a heart that believes,
I'm sure it will be of help to you...

00:23:30.841 --> 00:23:37.651
I'll give you my love lullaby...

00:23:46.031 --> 00:23:48.021
I'm Hikaru Shidou!

00:23:48.601 --> 00:23:50.651
Alcyone's sudden appearance.

00:23:50.761 --> 00:23:56.401
Her barrage of attacks were much
more powerful than they had ever been.

00:23:56.941 --> 00:24:01.571
We tried to convince her to use her power
for the good of Cephiro...

00:24:02.141 --> 00:24:05.271
...but then, Alcyone's
behavior suddenly changed.

00:24:05.381 --> 00:24:07.351
Magic Knight Rayearth...

00:24:07.511 --> 00:24:09.381
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream.

00:24:09.381 --> 00:24:10.151
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream.

00:24:10.151 --> 00:24:12.151
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream
You have to watch it!

00:24:12.151 --> 00:24:13.391
Hikaru and Nova in the Dream

00:24:13.391 --> 00:24:21.321
Who is it today?

00:24:22.061 --> 00:24:24.431
Today, it is Ms. Umi!

00:24:25.071 --> 00:24:27.531
Look forward to the next episode!
Hey, everyone! Did you guess right?

00:24:27.531 --> 00:24:29.371
Look forward to the next episode!
I'll see you later!
